# 16. Positional Arguments

Arguments passed according to their position are called positional arguments.

```python
def student(name, age):
    print(name)
    print(age)

student("Niranjan", 20)
```

Here:

```text
"Niranjan" → name
20          → age
```

---

# 17. Mixing Positional and Keyword Arguments

We can combine them.

```python
