# 55. Key Takeaway

The main purpose of functions is **code reuse and organization**.

Instead of writing:

```text
Same code
Same code
Same code
Same code
```

we create:

```text
Function
   ↓
Reusable code
   ↓
Call whenever needed
```

For example:

```python
def calculate_total(price, quantity):
    return price * quantity

print(calculate_total(100, 5))
print(calculate_total(250, 3))
```

The same function can be reused with different inputs.

As I continue learning Python for cybersecurity, functions will become important for building:

```text
Automation Scripts
Log Analyzers
Network Tools
File Analyzers
Security Utilities
CTF Scripts
